            </note>
            <note corresp="#d690-f2" n="2" xml:id="d690-f2-content">
                <p>For text of the U.S. note of August 16, released to the press that same day, see
                    Department of State <hi rendition="#italic">Bulletin</hi>, August 27, 1951, p.
                    348.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
